# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:12
translate italian gertrude7_e4a486c5:

    # "I start talking with Gertrude about the things that have been on my mind the last few days, but very quickly notice that she's not paying attention."
    "Comincio a parlare con Gertrude delle cose che mi sono passate per la testa negli ultimi giorni, ma mi accorgo subito che non mi sta prestando attenzione."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:13
translate italian gertrude7_97b63e7d:

    # "She seems upset about something."
    "Sembra turbata per qualcosa."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:14
translate italian gertrude7_aae39d82:

    # pc "Hey, Gertrude? You okay?"
    pc "Ehi, Gertrude? Tutto bene?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:16
translate italian gertrude7_efec7b50:

    # sc "Sorry, what? I kind of blanked out for a while there."
    sc "Scusa, cosa? Mi sono distratta per un po'."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:17
translate italian gertrude7_482afb8f:

    # pc "Yeah, I noticed. What's going on?"
    pc "Sì, l’ho notato. Che succede?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:19
translate italian gertrude7_cec5b723:

    # sc "It's just been a bad day."
    sc "È solo stata una brutta giornata."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:20
translate italian gertrude7_e262f6a2:

    # pc "But the day has just started."
    pc "Ma la giornata è appena iniziata."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:21
translate italian gertrude7_f0bbe887:

    # sc "Yeah, well yesterday was bad too. And the day before. And probably the day before that."
    sc "Sì, beh, anche ieri è andata male. E l’altro ieri. E probabilmente anche il giorno prima."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:22
translate italian gertrude7_7ce1ef4f:

    # pc "Sounds rough. Want to talk about it?"
    pc "Sembra dura. Vuoi parlarne?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:23
translate italian gertrude7_f2ba9b25:

    # sc "I probably shouldn't."
    sc "Probabilmente non dovrei."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:24
translate italian gertrude7_9a6b5393:

    # pc "It's okay. We're friends, remember?"
    pc "Va bene. Siamo amici, ricordi?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:26
translate italian gertrude7_a064582c:

    # sc "Yeah, I guess we are."
    sc "Sì, immagino di sì."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:28
translate italian gertrude7_c6b054d3:

    # sc "Okay, so my husband is a VP at his company and he has to go away for weeks sometimes. I think we've talked about this before."
    sc "Ok, allora: mio marito è vicepresidente nella sua azienda e a volte deve stare via per settimane. Credo che ne abbiamo già parlato."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:29
translate italian gertrude7_abe3824b:

    # pc "Yeah, I remember."
    pc "Sì, me lo ricordo."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:30
translate italian gertrude7_d8c01a95:

    # sc "Well he's been away for two weeks right now. He was supposed to come back today, but he called this morning and told me he was going to be gone another week."
    sc "Beh, ormai è via da due settimane. Doveva tornare oggi, ma stamattina mi ha chiamato e mi ha detto che starà via ancora una settimana."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:31
translate italian gertrude7_f97068f9:

    # pc "Three weeks… that's rough."
    pc "Tre settimane… è dura."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:33
translate italian gertrude7_114695f1:

    # sc "What's worse is I think I heard another voice in the background when I was talking to him. A woman's voice. Whispering."
    sc "La cosa peggiore è che mi sembra di aver sentito un'altra voce in sottofondo mentre parlavo con lui. Una voce di donna. Che sussurrava."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:34
translate italian gertrude7_78bd9374:

    # pc "Maybe he was just around other people?"
    pc "Forse era semplicemente in compagnia di altre persone?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:35
translate italian gertrude7_d199aa10:

    # sc "He told me he was in his hotel room."
    sc "Mi ha detto che era nella sua stanza d’albergo."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:36
translate italian gertrude7_f8a26f59:

    # pc "Oof. Maybe it was just the TV?"
    pc "Uff. Forse era solo la TV?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:38
translate italian gertrude7_c1291f74:

    # sc "Maybe. But I've had a feeling he's been cheating on me for a while. This is just another thing to add to that suspicion."
    sc "Forse. Ma ho la sensazione che mi tradisca già da un po’. Questa è solo un’altra cosa che va ad aggiungersi a quel sospetto."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:39
translate italian gertrude7_df2e8061:

    # pc "Sorry, Gertrude."
    pc "Mi dispiace, Gertrude."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:41
translate italian gertrude7_bb8360c8:

    # sc "Yeah. I'm not sure what to do."
    sc "Sì. Non so bene cosa fare."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:43
translate italian gertrude7_124214fb:

    # sc "Maybe I'll just find myself a college guy and cheat on him right back."
    sc "Magari mi cercherò un ragazzo del college e lo tradirò a mia volta."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:47
translate italian gertrude7_a472e7bd:

    # sc "I bet you would!"
    sc "Ci scommetto!"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:48
translate italian gertrude7_9155355e:

    # sc "You're kind of a player, aren't you?"
    sc "Sei un po’ una seduttrice, vero?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:49
translate italian gertrude7_64b00869:

    # pc "I'm just trying to help you out here."
    pc "Sto solo cercando di darti una mano."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:50
translate italian gertrude7_e344197a:

    # sc "Yeah, sure you are."
    sc "Sì, certo che sì."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:52
translate italian gertrude7_dee19707:

    # sc "Oh, thanks for that. I needed a laugh."
    sc "Oh, grazie mille. Avevo proprio bisogno di farmi una risata."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:55
translate italian gertrude7_1d5aeafb:

    # sc "Thanks, [pcname]."
    sc "Grazie, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:57
translate italian gertrude7_09c5f7bb:

    # sc "I shouldn't though. Two wrongs don't make a right, you know."
    sc "Non dovrei, però. Due torti non fanno una ragione, lo sai."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:58
translate italian gertrude7_990441d4:

    # pc "Yeah. But sometimes, even if it's wrong, it feels right."
    pc "Sì. Ma a volte, anche se è sbagliato, sembra giusto."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:60
translate italian gertrude7_94da6d28:

    # sc "Yeah, I guess it does."
    sc "Sì, immagino di sì."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:63
translate italian gertrude7_a0094ffa:

    # sc "Yeah, you're probably right."
    sc "Sì, probabilmente hai ragione."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:64
translate italian gertrude7_2caddb85:

    # sc "Two wrongs don't make a right, as my mother always said."
    sc "Due torti non fanno una ragione, come diceva sempre mia madre."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:65
translate italian gertrude7_14520e38:

    # sc "Even though sometimes doing wrong things feels right."
    sc "Anche se a volte fare cose sbagliate sembra giusto."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:67
translate italian gertrude7_4e6348a3:

    # sc "Anyway, now that you've been my counselor for the morning, you better get to class."
    sc "Comunque, ora che sei stata la mia consulente per tutta la mattinata, faresti meglio ad andare a lezione."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:68
translate italian gertrude7_b1563ec7:

    # pc "Okay, I'll talk to you later."
    pc "Ok, ci sentiamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:71
translate italian gertrude7_98ca816f:

    # "We both stand up, very close to each other. Looking at each other."
    "Ci alziamo entrambi, molto vicini l’uno all’altra. Ci guardiamo."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:74
translate italian gertrude7_ac0b2138:

    # "I start to lean in to kiss her."
    "Comincio ad avvicinarmi per baciarla."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:77
translate italian gertrude7_951013bf:

    # "But she quickly puts her hand on my shoulder and holds me back, pulling away from me."
    "Ma lei mi mette subito una mano sulla spalla e mi trattiene, allontanandosi da me."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:78
translate italian gertrude7_2262058f:

    # sc "You should head to class, [pcname]."
    sc "Dovresti andare a lezione, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:79
translate italian gertrude7_877ec67b:

    # pc "Right. Sorry."
    pc "Giusto. Scusa."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:80
translate italian gertrude7_cfee34fc:

    # sc "It's okay. I'll see you later, okay?"
    sc "Va bene. Ci vediamo più tardi, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:81
translate italian gertrude7_850ead77:

    # pc "Okay. Bye, Gertrude."
    pc "Ok. Ciao, Gertrude."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:85
translate italian gertrude7_fe8a244e:

    # "I wrap my arms around her and pull her close."
    "La stringo tra le braccia e la attiro a me."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:86
translate italian gertrude7_03e06438:

    # "At first, she is a little stiff, but she quickly relaxes and returns the hug, pressing herself against me."
    "All’inizio è un po’ rigida, ma si rilassa subito e ricambia l’abbraccio, stringendosi contro di me."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:87
translate italian gertrude7_b5efc9fe:

    # "We hold each other like that for a little longer than normal for a casual, friendly hug."
    "Restiamo così un po’ più a lungo di quanto sia normale per un abbraccio informale e amichevole."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:88
translate italian gertrude7_3abc9c1d:

    # "When I finally start to pull away, she lets go of me reluctantly."
    "Quando finalmente comincio ad allontanarmi, mi lascia andare a malincuore."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:92
translate italian gertrude7_8e28123b:

    # sc "Thanks for that, [pcname]. That was nice. But you better get to class."
    sc "Grazie, [pcname]. È stato bello. Ma è meglio che tu vada a lezione."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:93
translate italian gertrude7_1070058d:

    # pc "Yeah, okay. Bye, Gertrude."
    pc "Sì, va bene. Ciao, Gertrude."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:95
translate italian gertrude7_0e8f1b03:

    # pc "Well, I better get to class."
    pc "Beh, è meglio che vada a lezione."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:96
translate italian gertrude7_5c60e9c3:

    # sc "Right. Okay, see you later, [pcname]."
    sc "Giusto. Ok, ci vediamo più tardi, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:97
translate italian gertrude7_6679f75b:

    # pc "Bye, Gertrude."
    pc "Ciao, Gertrude."

# game/Scenes/Gertrude/gertrude7.rpy:100
translate italian gertrude7_d7e41755:

    # "I leave her office and head to class."
    "Esco dal suo ufficio e mi dirigo a lezione."

